    "scope": "Four useful exterior pictures and standard PMTiles/DEM only. Photographs are linked, not redistributed. No bespoke survey.",
    "pictures": [
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Domkerk_2024_gezien_vanaf_de_Domtoren.jpg",
