        "author": "HenkvD",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "notes": "Inspected 2024 elevated west view: surviving long north/south transept and narrow eastern choir, gray slate cross roof, warm mixed brick/stone Gothic fronts, three tall west window bays on each side of central gable, open square toward separate tower. Temporary central trompe-l’oeil installation is not an interior or restored nave; omit that artwork. Low south cloister and rectangular garden visible."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Utrecht_Dom_Sint_Martin_Chor_1.jpg",
        "image": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a7/Utrecht_Dom_Sint_Martin_Chor_1.jpg",
        "author": "Zairon",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "notes": "Inspected east/side choir: polygonal upper clerestory and lower ambulatory/chapels, very tall pointed glazing, pale stone tracery, red-gray masonry piers, flying buttresses, pinnacles and low parapet. Tall transept gable and small corner turret behind."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Domtoren_Utrecht_-_2.jpg",
        "image": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/86/Domtoren_Utrecht_-_2.jpg",
        "author": "ErikHonig",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-3.0-nl",
        "notes": "Inspected elevated whole-complex context: separate tall tower west across open square, surviving transept/choir east and low U-shaped south cloister. No modeled connecting nave."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Domtoren_taken_from_Mariaplaats,_Utrecht.jpg",
        "image": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/Domtoren_taken_from_Mariaplaats%2C_Utrecht.jpg",
        "author": "Ginelly.Q",
        "license": "CC0",
        "notes": "Inspected closer tower elevation: broad square lower stages, narrower second stage with paired tall pointed belfry arches, open octagonal upper lantern with slender stone ribs/pinnacles, gray pointed cap and small finial. Warm street/sunset lighting not baked into colors."
      }
    ]
